SKYTRACK INTEGRATION FILES

1. Replace the existing repository index.html with this updated index.html.
   Existing module buttons and module behavior are retained; SkyTrack is added
   to desktop and mobile module menus.
2. Upload SkyTrack.html to the repository root.
3. Upload flight_position.json to the repository root.
4. The SkyTrack page reads ./flight_position.json. Keep both files together.

IMPORTANT:
- This JSON is an initial no-data status record, not a live position.
- No background updater is enabled in this integration set yet.
- Live tracking requires an authorized, configured data source and a scheduled
  GitHub Actions workflow. Do not treat this preview as live aircraft data.
- Preserve the existing filenames and paths of all other modules.
